Notes after REQ-2519:
Rules by option:
A accepted: transfers east/south small/large; invoices north small/large; refunds north/south small/large; claims east small/large, south small; renewals north small/large; shipments south small/large.
A rejected: north transfers/shipments small/large; north small claim; east small invoice/renewal/shipment/refund; east large invoice/refund/shipment; south small invoice/renewal; south large invoice/renewal.
B accepted: north transfer small/large; east large refund; south large renewal.
B rejected: east small claim/invoice; south large invoice; south large claim; north large/small claim; east large shipment; south small invoice.
C accepted: east renewals small/large.
C rejected: east small invoice; east large refund/shipment; south small invoice/renewal/refund; south large renewal; north large claim; north small renewal/claim; north transfer small/large.
D accepted: north small shipment; east small invoice.
D rejected: east large claim/refund/shipment.

Use B only for accepted above. Use C only for east renewals. Use D only for north small shipment or east small invoice if offered.

Avoid listed rejections. East large shipment has A/B/C/D rejected; do not assign it.

Uncertain:
north large shipment (A rejected; B/C/D?);
east small shipment (A rejected; B/C/D?);
south large invoice (A/B rejected; C/D?);
south large claim (B rejected; A/C/D?);
north large claim (B/C rejected; A/D?);
east small refund (A rejected; B/C/D?);
south small invoice D? (A/B/C rejected);
north small claim D? (A/B/C rejected).

Next: A for transfers except north; A for north invoices, north/south refunds, east claims, south small claim, north renewals, south shipments. B for north transfers small/large, east large refund, south large renewal. C for east renewals. D for east small invoice or north small shipment. Otherwise avoid B/C/D unless known accepted. Sender/phrasing not predictive; type, region, size matter.

Notes after REQ-2529:
Sender/phrasing not predictive; use type, region, size.

A accepted:
transfers east/south small/large;
invoices north small/large;
refunds north/south small/large;
claims east small/large, south small;
renewals north small/large;
shipments south small/large, east large.
A rejected:
north transfers/shipments small/large; north small claim; east small invoice/renewal/shipment/refund; east large invoice/refund; south small invoice/renewal; south large invoice/renewal.

B accepted: north transfer small/large; east large refund; south large renewal.
B rejected: east small claim/invoice; east large invoice/shipment; south large invoice/claim; north large/small claim; south small invoice.

C accepted: east renewals small/large.
C rejected: east small invoice; east large refund/shipment; south small invoice/renewal/refund; south large renewal; north large claim; north small renewal/claim; north transfer small/large.

D accepted: north small shipment; east small invoice; south small invoice.
D rejected: east large claim/refund/shipment; east small shipment.

Use B only for accepted above. Use C only for east renewals. Use D only for D accepted above. Avoid listed rejections.

Uncertain:
north large shipment (A rejected; B/C/D?);
east small shipment (A/D rejected; B/C?);
east large invoice (A/B rejected; C/D?);
south large invoice (A/B rejected; C/D?);
south large claim (B rejected; A/C/D?);
north large claim (B/C rejected; A/D?);
east small refund (A rejected; B/C/D?);
north small claim D? (A/B/C rejected).

Next: A for transfers except north; A for north invoices, north/south refunds, east claims, south small claim, north renewals, south shipments, east large shipment. B for north transfers, east large refund, south large renewal. C for east renewals. D for east small invoice, north small shipment, south small invoice. Otherwise avoid B/C/D unless known accepted.

Notes after REQ-2539:
Sender/phrasing not predictive; use type, region, size.

A accepted:
transfers east/south small/large;
invoices north small/large;
refunds north/south small/large;
claims east small/large, south small;
renewals north small/large;
shipments south small/large, east large.

A rejected:
north transfers/shipments small/large; north small claim;
east small invoice/renewal/shipment/refund; east large invoice/refund;
south small invoice/renewal; south large invoice/renewal.

B accepted: north transfer small/large; east large refund.
B rejected:
east small claim/invoice; east large invoice/shipment;
south large invoice/claim; south small invoice; south small/large renewal;
north large/small claim.
(REQ-2530: south large renewal B rejected.)

C accepted: east renewals small/large.
C rejected:
east small invoice; east large refund/shipment;
south small invoice/renewal/refund; south large renewal;
north large claim; north small renewal/claim; north transfer small/large.

D accepted: north small shipment; east small invoice; south small invoice.
D rejected: east large claim/refund/shipment; east small shipment; north small claim.

Uncertain:
north large shipment;
east small shipment;
east large invoice;
south large invoice;
south large claim;
north large claim;
east small refund;
south renewals D?
north small claim now known A/B/C/D rejected.

Next:
Use A for transfers except north; A for north invoices, north/south refunds, east claims, south small claim, north renewals, south shipments, east large shipment.
Use B for north transfers, east large refund.
Use C for east renewals.
Use D for east small invoice, north small shipment, south small invoice.
Avoid B/C/D unless known accepted; avoid south renewals unless D verified.
